{
  "_comment_overview": "両ツールの hook 設定ファイル例。コメントは JSON 標準ではないので、コピーして使う際は '_comment*' フィールドを削除すること。",

  "_comment_claude": "===== Claude Code: ~/.claude/settings.json の hooks 節 (ネスト構造) =====",
  "_claude_example": {
    "hooks": {
      "PreToolUse": [
        {
          "matcher": "Bash",
          "hooks": [
            {
              "type": "command",
              "command": "python ${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/check_bash.py"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "matcher": "Edit|Write|MultiEdit",
          "hooks": [
            {
              "type": "command",
              "command": "python /home/user/.claude/hooks/redirect-tmp.py"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "PostToolUse": [
        {
          "matcher": "Edit|Write|MultiEdit",
          "hooks": [
            {
              "type": "command",
              "command": "bash /home/user/.claude/hooks/markdownlint.sh"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "Stop": [
        {
          "hooks": [
            {
              "type": "command",
              "command": "python /home/user/.claude/hooks/update-adr-on-stop.py"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },

  "_comment_copilot": "===== Copilot CLI: ~/.copilot/hooks/<name>.json (フラット構造) =====",
  "_copilot_example": {
    "version": 1,
    "hooks": {
      "PreToolUse": [
        {
          "matcher": "^bash$",
          "type": "command",
          "bash": "python $HOME/.claude/hooks/check_bash.py",
          "powershell": "python $env:USERPROFILE\\.claude\\hooks\\check_bash.py",
          "timeoutSec": 30
        },
        {
          "matcher": "^(edit|create|view)$",
          "type": "command",
          "bash": "python $HOME/.claude/hooks/redirect-tmp.py",
          "timeoutSec": 30
        }
      ],
      "PostToolUse": [
        {
          "matcher": "^(edit|create)$",
          "type": "command",
          "bash": "bash $HOME/.claude/hooks/markdownlint.sh",
          "timeoutSec": 30
        }
      ],
      "Stop": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "bash": "python $HOME/.claude/hooks/update-adr-on-stop.py",
          "timeoutSec": 60
        }
      ]
    }
  },

  "_comment_notes": [
    "matcher の挙動が異なる:",
    "  - Claude: 'Bash' は exact match、'Edit|Write|MultiEdit' は OR",
    "  - Copilot: '^(?:pattern)$' で anchored される。'^bash$' / '^(edit|create)$' のように明示的に書く",
    "Copilot は bash と powershell の両キーで Windows 対応",
    "両ツール対応のスクリプトを書けば、設定ファイルだけ別々で管理できる"
  ]
}
